repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/interactor-taskweft-persona
abstract: >-
  The ask surface over the RECTGTN planner: a domain and a goal go in, an exact
  plan comes out, and no neural network is involved. The domain is a JSON-LD
  document of variables, actions and methods; the goal is a task list; the
  answer carries the ordered plan, the temporal block, and a failure tree when
  no plan exists. The engine is the planner's C++20 standalone headers, built
  against a pinned planner revision.
